  <section class="faq sec" id="honestly" aria-labelledby="hm-faq-h">
    <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
      <div class="head" data-reveal><h2 class="h2" id="hm-faq-h">Kratom, honestly.</h2></div>
      <div class="faq__list" data-faq>
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__q"><button type="button" id="hm-faq-b0" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="hm-faq-p0" data-track="faq_accordion_toggle" data-track-label="0"><span>What actually is kratom, and where does Dandy get it?</span>{{ ico_plus }}{{ ico_minus }}</button></h3>
          <div class="faq__panel" id="hm-faq-p0" role="region" aria-labelledby="hm-faq-b0"><div class="faq__a"><p>Kratom (Mitragyna speciosa) is a tropical evergreen tree native to Southeast Asia and a biological cousin of the coffee (Rubiaceae) plant family. Traditional communities have harvested and brewed the leaves for centuries to sustain physical endurance and ease tired limbs. The primary active botanical alkaloid is mitragynine, which is the exact compound we measure, standardize, and print on every single package. We source exclusively from mature trees cultivated by family farming collectives in Thailand.</p></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__q"><button type="button" id="hm-faq-b1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="hm-faq-p1" data-track="faq_accordion_toggle" data-track-label="1"><span>Will it get me high or impair my day?</span>{{ ico_plus }}{{ ico_minus }}</button></h3>
          <div class="faq__panel" id="hm-faq-p1" role="region" aria-labelledby="hm-faq-b1"><div class="faq__a"><p>No. Kratom is not cannabis, THC, or a synthetic substance. In proper daytime amounts, people describe a clear-headed lift similar to a clean cup of matcha or artisan cold brew, just without the jittery heart rate or digestive upset. At higher amounts, it promotes warm physical comfort. We do not make miracle claims or sell high-intensity intoxication: Dandy is formulated for functional, responsible adults who want to feel good and stay completely present.</p></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__q"><button type="button" id="hm-faq-b2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="hm-faq-p2" data-track="faq_accordion_toggle" data-track-label="2"><span>Is kratom legal to buy online?</span>{{ ico_plus }}{{ ico_minus }}</button></h3>
          <div class="faq__panel" id="hm-faq-p2" role="region" aria-labelledby="hm-faq-b2"><div class="faq__a"><p>Yes, kratom is legally recognized and regulated at the state level across the vast majority of the United States. Dandy operates in strict compliance with state laws: we ship to 34 legal states, and we do not ship to the 16 states where kratom is currently restricted (AL, AR, CA, CT, IN, KS, LA, MS, ND, NE, RI, TN, UT, VT, WV, and WI). Our checkout system automatically verifies your address and blocks restricted shipping destinations before any payment can be processed.</p></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__q"><button type="button" id="hm-faq-b3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="hm-faq-p3" data-track="faq_accordion_toggle" data-track-label="3"><span>How do I know exactly what is in my pouch or jar?</span>{{ ico_plus }}{{ ico_minus }}</button></h3>
          <div class="faq__panel" id="hm-faq-p3" role="region" aria-labelledby="hm-faq-b3"><div class="faq__a">
            <p>Every single production run is quarantined and sent to an accredited, independent third-party laboratory for comprehensive 4-panel testing:</p>
            <ul class="faq__ul">
              <li>Alkaloid potency: verifying exact mitragynine milligrams.</li>
              <li>Heavy metals: screening for lead, arsenic, cadmium, and mercury.</li>
              <li>Microbials: testing for salmonella, E. coli, yeasts, and molds.</li>
              <li>Purity: confirming zero adulterants, synthetic chemicals, or fillers.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>The specific batch number and a scannable QR code are printed on the back of every container. You can read the certificate of analysis (COA) for your bag directly on our site anytime.</p>
          </div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__q"><button type="button" id="hm-faq-b4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="hm-faq-p4" data-track="faq_accordion_toggle" data-track-label="4"><span>Who should not take kratom?</span>{{ ico_plus }}{{ ico_minus }}</button></h3>
          <div class="faq__panel" id="hm-faq-p4" role="region" aria-labelledby="hm-faq-b4"><div class="faq__a"><p>Dandy is strictly for adults 21 years of age and older. You should not take kratom if you are pregnant, nursing, or planning to become pregnant. If you take prescription medications or have a medical condition, talk to your physician or healthcare provider first. Like caffeine or other functional botanicals, daily habituation can occur with repeated use. We strongly advocate responsible stewardship: start with small servings, take scheduled rest days, and listen to your body.</p></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="faq__more"><a href="/pages/contact?view=dandy2-coa">View all lab reports and certificates of analysis{{ ico_chevron }}</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

